~ start
Wendy: Dan...
Wendy: Are you okay?
Danilo: [color=#808080]Should I tell Wendy... about what I remembered?[/color]
Wendy: Dan?
- Tell her about the figure from the memory =>< tell
- Keep it to yourself =>< keep
do leave_the_park()
=> END

~ tell
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_1_scene_3", "relief")
Danilo: Ah... something came back to me...
Danilo: When we were playing back then...
Danilo: I saw something...
Danilo: [wave]a shadowy figure...[/wave]
Danilo: It was following [color=#8B0000][i]him[/i][/color].
Wendy: A shadow?
Wendy: Dan... why are you only telling me this now?
Wendy: Why didn’t you mention it before?
Danilo: I don’t know... it just resurfaced now.
Danilo: It’s still blurry... but I’m sure someone was following him that day.
Wendy: Dan... this could mean something.
Wendy: If you remember anything else, even fragments, tell me right away.
Wendy: [shake]You’re remembering because a part of you wants to face it.[/shake]
Danilo: But... what if it’s my fault?
Danilo: What if I’m the reason he disappeared?
Wendy: It’s not your fault.
Wendy: But if we ever want peace... we have to face what really happened.
=> END

~ keep
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_1_scene_3", "restless")
Wendy: Are you sure you’re okay?
Wendy: You looked... distant.
Danilo: Ah... I just remembered [wave][color=#8B0000][i]him[/i][/color][/wave].
Wendy: Danilo... if there’s something you want to say...
Wendy: You know I’m always here, right?
Wendy: You don’t have to carry this alone.
Danilo: Yeah... thanks.
Danilo: [color=#808080](sighs)[/color]
Danilo: [color=#808080](I know... I should tell her.)[/color]
Danilo: [color=#808080](But... it still refuses to explain itself to me, yet.)[/color]
=> END

~ pauwi
Wendy: Have a safe trip, Danilo.
Danilo: You too, Wen. Thanks.
do re_enable_collisions()
do wendy_walk_away()
do Hud.show_objectives()
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(1, "Get home")
=> END

